MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- types.rs: MeteredState/RoamingState tri-state enums (§82/§83),
  PathCapabilities.metered changed from bool to MeteredState, new
  roaming field
- scoring.rs: metered_state_permits/permits_roaming_bulk wired into
  passes_hard_constraints (both treat Unknown conservatively); new
  congestion_suitability term in DefaultScorer::score (§79); 6 new
  tests for metered/roaming hard constraints, 3 new tests for
  congestion scoring
- requirements.rs: new allow_roaming_bulk field; file_chunk() bug fix
  (allow_metered was true, contradicting §82's own "block bulk"
  example) - now false, matching allow_roaming_bulk: false
- metrics.rs: new CongestionState enum + retransmission_rate/
  congestion_state fields on PathMetrics (§79); doc comment on
  EnergyCost explaining naming vs §84's own text (already covered,
  no rename)
- policy.rs: new congestion: f64 weight across all 7 PolicyWeights
  profiles
- stability.rs (new): derive_stability_score (§80), 5 tests
- lib.rs: mod stability; + updated doc-comment coverage map for
  §75-84 (75-78/81/84 documented as out-of-scope or already-covered)
- crates/siar-dtn-bundle/src/routing_bridge.rs: downstream fix for
  the new allow_roaming_bulk field (same pattern as round 2)
- mechanical: metered: false -> MeteredState::Unknown/Unmetered +
  roaming: RoamingState::Unknown across all PathCandidate literal
  test-helper sites (cache.rs, dispatch.rs, diversity.rs, estimate.rs,
  plan.rs, privacy.rs, quality.rs, scoring.rs, security.rs)

95/95 tests (up from 82), clippy clean, fmt clean, doc-warning-free.
Zero regressions in siar-dtn-bundle (37/37, after the fix above),
siar-identity-multidevice (251/251), siar-protocol-ext (115/115).
